safely be reused for an undergraduate application."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Embassy recommendation: where to begin",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Embassy recommendation: where to begin"}],[["$","p","A Japanese embassy or consulate serving the applicant's country handles initial recruitment and screening for this route. The available category, field, local opening date, documents, written examinations and interview instructions can vary by country.",{"children":"A Japanese embassy or consulate serving the applicant's country handles initial recruitment and screening for this route. The available category, field, local opening date, documents, written examinations and interview instructions can vary by country."}],["$","p","Follow the embassy's official announcement for your nationality. The central MEXT overview describes the process, but a blog's global deadline cannot replace the current local embassy notice.",{"children":"Follow the embassy's official announcement for your nationality. The central MEXT overview describes the process, but a blog's global deadline cannot replace the current local embassy notice."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Find the local Japanese diplomatic mission",{"children":"Find the local Japanese diplomatic mission"}],["$","li","Check available category and field",{"children":"Check available category and field"}],["$","li","Read the newest category guidelines",{"children":"Read the newest category guidelines"}],["$","li","Prepare the listed examinations and interview",{"children":"Prepare the listed examinations and interview"}],["$","li","Submit only through the stated local procedure",{"children":"Submit only through the stated local procedure"}]]}]]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a"]]}],"$L1b","$L1c"]}],"$L1d"]}]
