18:["$","section","University recommendation: a different gatekeeper",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"University recommendation: a different gatekeeper"}],[["$","p","In this route, a participating Japanese university recruits and screens candidates, then nominates selected applicants to MEXT. Not every university has a recommendation quota, and a university's internal selection is not the same as a scholarship being granted by MEXT.",{"children":"In this route, a participating Japanese university recruits and screens candidates, then nominates selected applicants to MEXT. Not every university has a recommendation quota, and a university's internal selection is not the same as a scholarship being granted by MEXT."}],["$","p","Search the exact university department for an international scholarship route, supervisor or exchange agreement where relevant, the application window and documents. Write directly to the university when its official instructions leave a critical question unanswered.",{"children":"Search the exact university department for an international scholarship route, supervisor or exchange agreement where relevant, the application window and documents. Write directly to the university when its official instructions leave a critical question unanswered."}]],"$undefined"]}]
19:["$","section","Compare language evidence and examinations",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Compare language evidence and examinations"}],[["$","p","The official MEXT overview lists Japanese and English examinations for some embassy categories, with additional subjects for others. University recommendation can follow different institutional admission processes. An absence of IELTS in a scholarship checklist is not proof that every course or immigration step waives language evidence.",{"children":"The official MEXT overview lists Japanese and English examinations for some embassy categories, with additional subjects for others. University recommendation can follow different institutional admission processes. An absence of IELTS in a scholarship checklist is not proof that every course or immigration step waives language evidence."}],["$","p","Match the instruction PDF to your category and intake. Ask the embassy or university about test substitutions only if its published rules do not resolve your case.",{"children":"Match the instruction PDF to your category and intake. Ask the embassy or university about test substitutions only if its published rules do not resolve your case."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1a:["$","section","Keep a route-specific application tracker",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep a route-specific application tracker"}],[["$","p","Use separate columns for scholarship category, embassy or university contact, intake, official call URL, deadline, examinations, nomination decision and university admission status. Save the guidance you relied on and check for later amendments.",{"children":"Use separate columns for scholarship category, embassy or university contact, intake, official call URL, deadline, examinations, nomination decision and university admission status. Save the guidance you relied on and check for later amendments."}],["$","p","Avoid paying anyone who promises a guaranteed embassy nomination or university recommendation. The final outcome is decided through the official selection stages, not by a private intermediary.",{"children":"Avoid paying anyone who promises a guaranteed embassy nomination or university recommendation. The final outcome is decided through the official selection stages, not by a private intermediary."}]],"$undefined"]}]
